{"duration": 35.876, "segs": [{"id": "hook", "start": 0.35, "end": 2.98, "text": "Tu ne sais plus quoi poster ? Garde cette vidéo."}, {"id": "formats", "start": 3.23, "end": 11.315, "text": "Voici quatre formats qui marchent à chaque fois : l'erreur à éviter, l'avant après, le tuto en trois étapes, et la réponse à un commentaire."}, {"id": "astuce", "start": 11.565, "end": 16.505, "text": "Et la meilleure source d'idées ? Tes commentaires. Chaque question, c'est une vidéo."}, {"id": "methode", "start": 16.755, "end": 22.43, "text": "Ma méthode : je note dix questions, je filme dix vidéos, et je les programme pour toute la semaine."}, {"id": "chiffre", "start": 22.68, "end": 25.599, "text": "Une heure de travail, et une semaine entière de contenu."}, {"id": "fin", "start": 25.849, "end": 33.276, "text": "J'explique tout, étape par étape, dans ma formation de marketing digital. Écris VIP en commentaire, et je t'envoie tout."}], "words": [{"w": "Tu", "a": 0.35, "b": 0.46, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "ne", "a": 0.514, "b": 0.624, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "sais", "a": 0.679, "b": 0.898, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "plus", "a": 0.953, "b": 1.172, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "quoi", "a": 1.227, "b": 1.446, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "poster", "a": 1.501, "b": 1.829, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "?", "a": 1.884, "b": 1.939, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "Garde", "a": 1.994, "b": 2.268, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "cette", "a": 2.322, "b": 2.596, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "vidéo.", "a": 2.651, "b": 2.98, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "Voici", "a": 3.23, "b": 3.519, "seg": "formats"}, {"w": "quatre", "a": 3.576, "b": 3.923, "seg": "formats"}, {"w": "formats", "a": 3.981, "b": 4.385, "seg": "formats"}, {"w": "qui", "a": 4.443, "b": 4.616, "seg": "formats"}, {"w": "marchent", "a": 4.674, "b": 5.136, "seg": "formats"}, {"w": "à", "a": 5.193, "b": 5.251, "seg": "formats"}, {"w": "chaque", "a": 5.309, "b": 5.655, "seg": "formats"}, {"w": "fois", "a": 5.713, "b": 5.944, "seg": "formats"}, {"w": ":", "a": 6.002, "b": 6.06, "seg": "formats"}